Subject: [PATCH] nilfs2: delete unnecessary condition in load_segment_summary
Date: Thu, 18 Feb 2010 19:11:35 +0900
Message-ID: <87sk8yn99k.wl%jir@sekiba.com>
Mime-Version: 1.0 (generated by SEMI 1.14.6 - "Maruoka")
